1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,610
Saan nga ba galing ang
kuryente sa bahay mo?

2
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:05,830
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

3
00:00:06,180 --> 00:00:09,770
Habang may araw, solar ang
unang sumusuplay sa bahay.

4
00:00:10,070 --> 00:00:14,840
Kapag sobra, puwedeng i-export
sa grid kung naka-net metering.

5
00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:18,450
Kung may battery, puwede
rin itong mag-charge.

6
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:22,740
Sa gabi, battery o grid
na ang nagsu-supply.

7
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:26,430
Kapag alam mo ang daloy,
mas madaling magtipid.

8
00:00:26,830 --> 00:00:31,980
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

9
00:00:32,330 --> 00:00:34,510
Life is SoLight with Solar.
